{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415712","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415712","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1041571201:1":{"text":"Hey, Aurora! Why do you look so sleepy?","source_cn":"呀！奥萝菈，你怎么一副没睡醒的样子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46C2473FBC4A5792","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041571202:1":{"text":"I had a very confusing dream.","source_cn":"唔……我做了一个很……很混乱的梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE20EDA2B3D743F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041571203:1":{"text":"I dreamed of a desert, and there was a giant whale flying up in the sky...","source_cn":"我梦到了一片沙漠，沙漠的天空中飞翔着一只巨大的鲸鱼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79124BE0015E6527","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041571204:1":{"text":"Ah, you must've thought it was super lonely.","source_cn":"啊……那你一定会觉得它很孤单！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D4DED8E77050410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041571205:1":{"text":"Yes, that's right.","source_cn":"嗯，没错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9BBABAD0284468D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041571206:1":{"text":"I thought to myself, \"If the whale could meet some friends, that'd be nice.\"","source_cn":"“要是，它能见到同伴，就好了”……我这样想了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC48412B6A56E7C16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041571207:1":{"text":"And then it started pouring right in the middle of the desert. The water just kept rising and rising until it became a huge sea.","source_cn":"然后，沙漠就下起了暴雨……水面上升，最后变成一片汪洋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF26FF825A72BDF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041571208:1":{"text":"It felt like a tsunami...","source_cn":"简直就像……经历了一场海啸……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B69D90FDB607404","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041571209:1":{"text":"I think I saw you in my dream, Tasi... You weren't swallowed up by the sea, were you?","source_cn":"塔西，我好像在梦里的沙漠见过你……你没有被海水吞没吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x150A49CFB6CDF3C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041571210:1":{"text":"Oh, I-I'm fine!","source_cn":"哦……我、我一点事也没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA23F65C0D07B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041571211:1":{"text":"I'm a dream fairy. How could I get hurt in a dream?","source_cn":"我可是梦境妖精，怎么会在梦里受伤呢……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37718CCAEDF112F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041571212:1":{"text":"That's good to hear...","source_cn":"嗯，那就好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D5F16111AFA4CED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041571213:1":{"text":"I think I need some more sleep. I'm so tired...","source_cn":"我……我觉得我需要再睡一觉，感觉很累……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC57D76E129E95678","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041571214:1":{"text":"That's right. You should rest for a while! Maybe I'll take a nap too.","source_cn":"没错没错，你还是再休息一会吧！我也要去——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29DB944329B29AA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041571215:0":{"text":"<shk>So you were here all along, Tasi!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>——塔西！你竟然在这里！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11B3CA9A635D524B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041571216:0":{"text":"You no-good pixie! Look at the mess you made of Aurora's dream! That tsunami of yours had me wading through water for three days!","source_cn":"你这坏心眼的小蝴蝶！竟然把奥萝菈的梦搅得一塌糊涂！那海...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5DA485C1CF83F48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041571217:1":{"text":"What? Tasi did that?","source_cn":"……咦？是塔西做的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB41E1F47D8D4359C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041571218:1":{"text":"I-I didn't mean to! Aurora wanted the whale to meet some friends, and I just wanted to help...","source_cn":"我、我不是故意的！奥萝菈想让鲸鱼见见同伴，我只是想帮个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE43E6A1C2FEB6FCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041571219:0":{"text":"Stars above! No more helping! The things you're having her dream up are scarier than a Hypogean with a thorn stuck in its foot.","source_cn":"哦，天哪！你可别再帮忙了，你哄她变出来的东西简直比恶魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAC6695FDA3F3673","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041571220:0":{"text":"I'm banning you from entering Aurora's dream! Lifetime ban!","source_cn":"我要禁止你进入奥萝菈的梦境——禁止！禁止！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF7290BA35A88E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:塔西":{"text":"Tasi","source":"塔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"Aurora","source":"奥萝菈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:桑尼":{"text":"Sonny","source":"桑尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":3}}